34. DATA PRIVACY

User photos are sensitive personal content.

The application should clearly explain:

Why the image is uploaded
Whether it is stored
Whether it is deleted
Whether badges are public

Default behavior should preferably avoid permanent photo storage unless necessary.

If canvas generation can happen entirely client-side, prefer that.

Add a privacy note:

Your photo is used only to generate your badge.

Only make this claim if the implementation actually guarantees it.

35. OPTIONAL NO-STORAGE MODE

